<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>It’s Real</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Lil Candy Paint</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">EVERYTHANG PURPLE (Deluxe)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4uGxcXxCyDSrzzDTz4T8or</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">3 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It’s Real Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They've never been so excited to see you in their fucking life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sheriff! Sherrif the producer</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She just walked in like, "Honey, I'm home"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Another backend, I'm coming home from the road</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She having doubts again, she don't know what's going on</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It keep on vibrating, and she like, "Who that on your phone?"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you wrong or you right, know it's me and you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Fuck the feelings, they don't see what I see in you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When I'm capping, all that bullshit, girl, you seeing through</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you die before I die, just know I'm dying too</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got love for you in so many ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've been high so you can't blame me for my ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got love for you in so many ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've been high so you can't blame me for my ways</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Excuse me, I'm higher than a plane is</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Walked in, stumblin, no I cannot tame this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When she threw it from the back, I almost came in</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If I hit this blunt again, what you name is?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Elevator to the top</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We gettin' everything these niggas not</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ben Franklin hanging off of like every knot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She don't trust me, she think I'm fucking every thot[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Nah-nah-nah-nah-nah-nah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Nah-nah-nah-nah-nah-nah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Nah-nah-nah-nah-nah-nah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Nah-nah-nah-nah-nah-nah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Nah-nah-nah-nah-nah-nah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Nah-nah-nah-nah-nah-nah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Nah-nah-nah-nah-nah-nah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Nah-nah-nah-nah-nah-nah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 3]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I ain't Tempurpedic, baby, I ain't slept on</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If I said I love you, baby, don't get me stepped on</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Taking trips to Bora Bora, that's just a stepstone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I make cash across the border, yeah, I'm well known</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We so high right now, got no signal on my cell phone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When I was locked up, who had hit me on that jail phone?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You can have anything you want, just know that bread long (Beep)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Not tryna fall in love and leave my head gone[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know I love you for real</p></div></body></tt>